    "description": "Adds a Sketch tool (Design tab) to draw freehand notes, lines and shapes on an overlay above the map. Multiple named sketches per map, adjustable layer and opacity, eraser, undo/redo, excluded from exports. Contains a building generator that can be converted to walls/doors/windows.",
